  unitName: Vicious Twin-Edge Logan
  unitId: 60286
  unitNumber: 1137
  description: During the violent battle against the gods, Logan was possessed by
    the Cursed Armor piece that was incorporated into his "remodeling". When he finally
    regained consciousness, he found his best friend dying at his feet. Completely
    heartbroken, Logan remembered how his friend had asked him to live on, and thus
    headed toward the land of the fairies. There, he taught his twin sword style
    to a young prodigy, all whilst holding on to a strange piece of armor with the
    words "No.6" carved upon it.
  summonDesc: The Cursed Fire Armor, [[Unleashed Ravana Vishra|Vishra]]...<br>What
    it hated wasn't this world,<br>but perhaps those who live in it.
  fusionDesc: The wounds left on my body and heart<br>still pain me, even now.<br>Growing
    stronger hurts, doesn't it?
  evoDesc: My friend's words brought me back...<br>I shall wield my twin blades again<br>and
    house the will of the Cursed<br>Armor within myself!
  element: 6
  rarity: 6
